amet = (t:n) (w:profit/gain/interest) (d:Profit or interest, met written together with a, its: what is gained on top of a sum of money.) (e:ka dangka teng leh ~ ka ngahkhawm/adang ~ talen nga a ngah hi | he gained five more talents/adang talen nih ~ ka ngah zo hi | I have gained two more talents/adang ~ talen nih mah a ngah hi | he also gained two more talents) (s:ameet/met/meet) (a:supna) (r:40.25.27/40.25.16/40.25.22/40.25.17) (q:draft)
