ankungnote = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:young plants/seedlings) (d:ankung, crop plant, with no, young or small, and the plural te) (e:Tua ~ in zung thuk kha zo lo/tua ~ vulin a keu hi | those young plants wilted and dried up) (r:41.4.6/40.13.6) (q:draft)
