appa = (t:n) (w:one who dedicates) (d:ap, dedicate, with -pa, a man: the man who dedicates something) (e:Lo a ~ in a tat nop leh/A ~ in ama inn a tat nop leh | if the one who dedicates it wishes to redeem his house) (b:ap) (r:3.27.19/3.27.15) (q:draft)
