bah = (t:v) (w:be exhausted/be faint/be worn out) (d:have no strength left; with gawp, utterly exhausted) (e:dahin husamin ka ~ gawp hi/A ~ gawp galtaite in | the exhausted fugitives) (s:gimlua) (r:25.2.11/24.48.45) (q:draft, low confidence)
bah = (t:v) (w:put to the mouth/feed) (d:lift food to the mouth) (e:a kam ah an a ~ tohkik ding) (r:20.19.24) (q:draft, low confidence)
