bit = (t:adj) (w:full/complete/whole) (d:complete to the end, mostly of a period of time, as kum khat bit, a full year, and kha khat bit, a full month; a bit-in means in full) (e:kum khat ~ sung amah in tatkik theih/Tua zawh kumnih ~ khit ciangin | after two full years had passed/nipi kal sagih ~ hi ding hi | it shall be seven full weeks/kha khat ~ kap ding hi | she shall mourn for a full month/Absalom kum nih ~ Jerusalem ah teeng hi | Absalom lived two full years in Jerusalem/a ~-in ka thukkik ding hi | I will pay back in full) (r:3.25.29/5.21.13/1.41.1/3.23.15/10.14.28/23.65.6) (q:draft)
