Bohan = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Bohan) (d:son of Reuben after whom a boundary stone between Judah and Benjamin was named) (r:6.15.6/6.18.17)
bok = (t:v) (w:fall facedown/bow down/prostrate oneself/crouch) (d:go down with the face to the ground, in fear, worship or submission; of an animal, crouch) (e:lau mahmahin a ~ uh hi/Moses leh Aaron pai-in ~ uh hi | Moses and Aaron went and fell facedown/Kumpi khempeuh ama mai-ah ~ uh hen la | may all kings bow down before him/na khe mai-ah hong ~ ding uh hi | they will bow down at your feet/a muh uh ciangin a mai-ah ~ uh a | when they saw him they fell down before him) (s:boksuk/maipuk/kunsuk) (a:dingto) (r:40.17.6/6.7.10/4.20.6/19.72.11/23.60.14/41.3.11) (q:draft)
