daituite = (t:n) (w:dews/dew) (d:plural of daitui) (e:vantung ~ na ngah kei ding) (b:daitui) (r:1.27.39) (q:draft)
dak = (t:v) (w:look/look out/look around/peer) (d:lift the eyes to look: khua dak is look around, van dak is look up to the sky) (e:Balaam khua ~ a/ka khanglo-a ka khua ~ hi | I awoke and looked around/hamsiat-in van ~ ding uh hi | cursing, they will look up to the sky/vantung lamah zong ~ ngam loin | not daring even to look up toward heaven/kongvangneu-ah hong ~ zial-in | he peers in at the window) (s:khuadak/en) (r:4.24.2/24.31.26/23.8.21/42.18.13/22.2.9) (q:draft)
