dalkuangte = (t:n) (w:dishes/plates) (d:plural of dalkuang, dish; named with hai, cup) (e:hai leh ~ a pualam na silsiang/haite, sumngo kuangte, ~ tui tawh sawpna | the washing of cups, bronze bowls and dishes with water/hai leh ~ a pua lam na silsiang uh | you clean the outside of the cup and dish) (s:kuangdaite) (b:dalkuang) (r:40.23.25/41.7.4/42.11.39) (q:draft)
