denglumin = (t:v) (w:stoning to death) (d:denglum stone to death, with the linking suffix in) (e:suang tawh ~ a hal uh hi) (b:denglum) (r:6.7.25) (q:draft)
denglumsak = (t:v) (w:have stoned to death/let stone to death) (d:denglum, stone to death, with the causative sak: have a person stoned to death by others) (e:mihonte khempeuh amah ~ in) (b:denglum) (r:3.24.14) (q:draft)
dengnuam = (t:v) (w:want to stone/wish to stone) (d:deng, throw at or stone, with nuam, want to) (e:manin hong ~ ka hi kei uh a/Pasian na simmawhbawl manin hong ~ ka hi uh | we want to stone you because you blaspheme God) (r:43.10.33) (q:draft)
dengtan = (t:v) (w:break off/strip/shatter) (d:deng, strike, with tan, broken off: strike a thing so that it breaks, as hail strips the trees) (e:gamlak singkung khempeuh ~ hi) (r:2.9.25) (q:draft)
dengtanin = (t:v) (w:striking and breaking/smashing) (d:dengtan strike and break, with the linking suffix in) (e:milim khete ~ a kithehthang hi) (s:dengzanin/satnenin) (b:dengtan) (r:27.2.34) (q:draft)
dengvui = (t:v) (w:turn to dust/crush to dust) (d:deng, throw down or strike, with vui, dust, as in leivui: break a thing down into dust) (e:hong ~ kik ding na hi hiam) (r:18.10.9) (q:draft)
