denkhapna = (t:n) (w:dashing down) (d:denkhap dash against the ground, with the noun suffix na; with ding, will dash to the ground) (e:naupang neute lei na ~ ding) (b:denkhap) (r:12.8.12) (q:draft, low confidence)
