dongte = (t:n) (w:end/outcome) (d:dong, until or as far as, with plural te; a thu tawpna dongte is how their matter goes on to its end, their final destiny) (e:a thu tawpna ~ ka tel hi) (b:dong) (r:19.73.17) (q:draft, low confidence)
dongtel = (t:v) (w:judge/examine/call to account) (d:dong, ask, with tel, clearly: question closely, test, or pass judgment on) (e:a ne mi ~ kei hen/Mi dang’ sawltak a ~ nangmah | you who judge the servant of another/Nangmah in thu ~ lo ding | you will not call to account/lungsim a hong ~ Pasian | God who examines our hearts) (s:thukhen/entel/kantel) (r:45.14.3/52.2.4/45.14.4/19.10.13) (q:draft)
dongtelin = (t:v) (w:examining/testing/questioning closely) (d:dongtel, find out by asking, examine, with the linking suffix in) (e:a ci mite ~ sawltak ahihlohna uh/Pasian tawh kipawl hiam, kipawl lo hiam ~, en un | test and see whether they are from God or not/na u na nau ~ thu na khen hiam | do you pass judgment on your brother) (b:dongtel) (r:66.2.2/62.4.1/45.14.10) (q:draft)
dongun = (t:prep) (w:until/till) (d:dong, until, with the plural ending un, used when the persons spoken of are more than one) (e:a tha bei ~ kap uh hi/a kham ~ a si dawn ding uh hi | they will drink blood until they are full/lungsim kitamzan mite a sih ~ bawlsia hi | he hounded the brokenhearted to death/na tek ~ keimah in Amah ka hi a | until you are old I am he) (b:dong) (r:9.30.4/23.46.4/26.39.19/19.109.16) (q:draft)
dongzaw = (t:v) (w:ask rather/ask instead) (d:dong, ask, with zaw, rather; here a command to ask in this way instead) (e:ci-in ~ un) (b:dong) (r:24.23.37) (q:draft, low confidence)
