duh = (t:adj) (w:hungry) (d:with an, food: an duh is to be hungry, to want to eat) (e:A gilkial a, an a ~ hi | he was hungry and wanted food/an ~ gilkial lohna Izipt gamah | to the land of Egypt where there is no hunger for food/Gilkial a, an ~ banga lungsiangtho a deihte | those who desire holiness as the hungry desire food) (s:gilkial) (r:44.10.10/24.42.14/40.5.6) of food
