duhluat = (t:v) (w:crave/desire too much) (d:duh, desire, with luat, too much; duhluat mahmahna is a very great craving) (e:gamlakah ~ mahmahna nei uh a) (s:deihluat/duhgawh) (r:19.106.14) (q:draft)
duhluatna = (t:n) (w:craving/lust/excessive desire) (d:duhluat, desire too much, with the noun suffix na: a desire that is too strong, named together with deihluatna) (e:a piangsak thei ~ le deihluatnate panin) (s:duhhopna/huaihamna) (b:duhluat) (r:61.1.4) (q:draft)
