et = (t:v) (w:look/look at/watch/behold) (d:form of en, look, used before leh, ciangin, lai takin, ding and na and in dependent clauses) (e:Mualte ka ~ leh kiliing damdam uh a/Leitung ka ~ leh lim-le-mel nei lo a | I looked at the earth and it was formless/amaute in hong ~ lai takin | while they are watching you/Amah kunsukin a sung a ~ ciangin | when he bent down and looked inside/Zeisu in tua pa a ~ lai takin | as Jesus looked at that man) (r:24.4.24/44.1.10/24.4.23/26.12.5/43.20.5/42.18.24) (q:draft)
