ettelna = (t:n) (w:examination/examining/testing) (d:ettel, examine, with the noun suffix na: a close looking into something; lungsim tawng a ettelna is the weighing of the inmost heart) (e:na lungsim tawng a ~ phawk in) (s:sittelna/kanna) (b:ettel) (r:20.21.2/47.13.5) (q:draft)
