galna = (t:n) (w:condolence visit/mourning) (d:Going to the house of a dead person to mourn with the family, used in the phrase si galna; Ecclesiastes sets it against pawi simna, going to a feast.) (e:Pawi simna sangin si ~ hoihzaw hi) (r:21.7.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
galnan = (t:see) <galnan'na>
