galpa = (t:n) (w:enemy/adversary) (d:Gal, enemy, with pa, which marks a man: the enemy, a male foe.) (e:na khut sungah na ~ kong pia ding a/Mite ihmut kalun a ~ pai a | while people slept his enemy came/mi khat in a ~ mu leh | if a man finds his enemy/Ka ~ aw, kei hong mu na hi hiam | my enemy, have you found me) (s:galmi/langpa/kitotpihpa) (a:lawmpa) (b:gal) (r:9.24.4/40.13.25/9.24.19/11.21.20) (q:draft)
