Genubath = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Genubath) (d:son of Hadad the Edomite and the sister of Queen Tahpenes, brought up in the palace of Pharaoh) (r:11.11.20)
genzaak = (t:v) (w:proclaim/announce/make known) (d:gen tell with zaak, let hear: make something known aloud; written genzak in the other Bible text) (e:hotkhiatna thu a ~/kilemna thu a ~ | who proclaims peace) (s:genzak/taangko/tangko/zasak) (r:23.52.7) (q:draft)
genzak = (t:v) (w:proclaim/announce/make known) (d:gen tell with zak, let hear: make something known aloud; written genzaak in the other Bible text) (e:kilemna thu a ~/hotkhiatna thu a ~ | who proclaims salvation) (s:genzaak/taangko/tangko/zasak) (r:23.52.7) (q:draft)
