gialin = (t:adv) (w:spotted/patterned) (d:gial, spotted or patterned, with the suffix in: of animals marked with spots or streaks, and of cloth woven in a pattern) (e:dung gial, bem ~ puang uh hi/a ~ na gan ding hi | you shall weave it in a pattern) (b:gial) (r:1.31.12/2.28.39) (q:draft)
