Gideon = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Gideon) (d:son of Joash of the tribe of Manasseh, the judge who defeated the Midianites with three hundred men; also called Jerub-Baal) (e:Joash’ tapa ~ a gal simna panin) (r:7.8.13/7.6.36) (q:draft)
