Gidom = (t:name) (c:place) (w:Gidom) (d:place in Benjamin as far as which the Israelites pursued the fleeing Benjamites) (r:7.20.45)
gige = (t:adv) (w:continually/steadily/always) (d:after a verb, of a state that goes on without a break, as watching, waiting or remaining) (e:amau gamtatna khempeuh en ~ hi/siatna in su dingin amah ngak ~ hi | disaster keeps waiting to ruin him/ka muhna mahmah-ah om ~ uh hi | they are always before my eyes/kei tawh hong omkhawm ~ hi | he is always with me/thu hong khen ding lamtak phawk ~ un | keep in mind that he will judge you) (s:den/niloh/ngitnget) (r:19.33.15/28.7.2/18.18.12/24.20.11/21.11.9) (q:draft)
gih = (t:adj) (w:heavy) (d:form of gik, heavy, used before ciangin and na: a gih ciangin is when it grew heavy) (e:a sam a ~ ciangin amah in met hi) (r:10.14.26) (q:draft)
gihna = (t:n) (w:weight/heaviness) (d:gih, heavy, with the noun suffix na: how much something weighs) (e:a puan ~ in sumngo shekel tulnga ahi/kham a ~ in kham talen zaguk leh sawmguk-le-guk | the weight of the gold was 666 talents/ngun sabuaite adingin ngun a ~ | the weight of silver for the silver tables/A kilhnate a ~ in kham shekel sawmnga ahi hi | the weight of the nails was fifty shekels of gold) (s:gikzah) (b:gih) (r:9.17.5/18.26.8/14.9.13/13.28.16/14.3.9) (q:draft)
