gilkialin = (t:adj) (w:hungry) (d:gilkial, hungry, with the ending in: being hungry, in hunger) (e:khat ~ khat in kham lua-in/Mite gam lakah ~, gimin dangtak uh hi | the people are hungry, tired and thirsty in the wilderness/A om lai sunte ~ puksi ding uh hi | those who are left will die of hunger/tagahte ~ ka koihkhong ngei kei hi | I have never left the fatherless hungry) (b:gilkial) (r:46.11.21/10.17.29/26.6.12/18.31.17)
