gimna = (t:n) (w:pain/suffering/trouble/woe) (d:gim with the noun suffix na: pain, hardship or trouble that someone suffers; gimna thuak is to suffer, and gimna ngah ta hen is woe to) (e:Tuate khempeuh in ~ kipat cilna ahi hi/keimah tawh ~ na thuak khawm in | share in suffering with me/siam a kisate in ~ ngah ta hen | woe to those who think themselves clever/Nihna ~ a bei zo hi | the second woe has passed) (s:thuakna/gentheihna) (a:nopna/nopsakna) (b:gim) (r:40.24.8/18.30.16/55.2.3/23.5.21/66.11.14)
