gimthuakna = (t:n) (w:suffering/punishment/affliction) (d:what one has to suffer, also as punishment) (e:Ama ~ hangin nopna i ngah a/amaute’ ~ kip paisuak ding hi | their punishment will last forever/ka ~-ah ka kisia khinzo ta ding hi | I would have perished in my affliction/misite thawhkikna le tawntung ~ | the resurrection of the dead and eternal punishment) (s:gimna/thuakna) (b:gimthuak) (r:23.53.5/19.81.15/19.119.92/58.6.2) (q:draft)
