ginalote = (t:n) (w:the weak/the lowly) (d:people of no strength or standing who need to be defended) (e:~ leh pa nei lote tungah thuman un/A ~ leh a cimawhte hon un la | rescue the weak and the needy) (s:thanemte/zawngkhalte) (a:thahatte/hatte) (r:19.82.3/19.82.4) (q:draft, low confidence)
