hehzawk = (t:v) (w:be more angry/be enraged) (d:heh, be angry, with zawk, the form of zaw, more, used before another word) (e:pasal a ~ theih nading thudang) (r:20.6.34) (q:draft, low confidence)
hei = (t:n) (w:axe) (d:tool with an iron head for cutting wood) (e:~ tawh hong kuan uh hi/tulak singte ~ tawh phuk ding a | he will cut down the forest trees with an axe/a khut-in ~ khat la-in | he took an axe in his hand/sing phungah ~ a om hi | the axe is at the root of the tree) (s:heipi) (r:24.46.22/9.13.20/23.10.34/7.9.48/40.3.10) (q:draft)
hei = (t:v) (w:turn/turn aside/pervert) (d:turn something in another direction or over to someone; with thu or thukham, twist or pervert justice) (e:Samuel nusia dingin a nung ~ ciangin/lupna tungah lumin a mai ~ a | lying on his bed he turned his face away/Jessi’ tapa David tungah kumpi gam ~ hi | he turned the kingdom over to David son of Jesse/thuman kimlai a khialin na ~ uh hi | you distort what is right) (r:9.10.9/20.31.5/11.21.4/13.10.14/33.3.9) (q:draft)
