hihlo = (t:v) (w:not do) (d:hih, do, with the negative lo written as one word; bangmah hihlo is do nothing) (e:Amah in bangmah ~ ding hi/a lian hitaleh a neu hitaleh bangmah ~ hi | he does nothing, great or small/hih ding a cihte ~ ding ci-in | saying he will not do what he said he would do/tawh kizui-in ~ na hih manin | because you did not carry it out) (r:24.5.12/9.20.2/47.1.19/9.28.18) (q:draft)
