hoi = (t:v) (w:stagger/reel/lean/totter) (d:sway or lean over as if about to fall, like a drunk person or a leaning wall) (e:Leitung pumpi zukham bangin ~ ding a/a nek ciangin khamin ~ ding uh hi | when they drink it they will reel, drunk/A inn tungah kingam a, a inn ~ hi | he leans on his house, but it gives way/a ~ kawm, a kiliing gawl tawh a kibang | like a leaning wall and a tottering fence/~ dangdangin a hailawh ding uh | they will stagger and go mad) (s:awn/hoihoi) (r:23.24.20/18.12.25/38.12.2/18.8.15/19.62.3/24.25.16) (q:draft)
