hoihpenna = (t:n) (w:best part/the best) (d:hoihpen, best, with the noun suffix na: where something is best; a hoihpenna mun is the best place) (e:gam sung khempeuh panin a ~ munah/lei ~ mun ama adingin teel hi | he chose the best land for himself) (b:hoihpen) (r:26.20.6/5.33.21) (q:draft)
