hoihsate = (t:n) (w:good deeds/righteous deeds/good things done) (d:hoih good with sa already and plural te: the good that has been done; gamtat hoihsate, former good conduct) (e:ama gamtat ~ phawkin ka nei kei ding hi) (r:26.3.20) (q:draft)
