hoihtakin = (t:adj) (w:properly/well) (d:hoihtak with the adverb ending in: well, carefully, properly) (e:a innkuansung ~ a ukzote hi ding hi/na bawnghonte ~ kem in | take good care of your herds/Na tuuhonte ~ thei inla | know your flocks well/na it ding uh ~ ngaihsun un | take good care to love him/~ a kibawl kherub-te tawh kizem ding hi | it shall be adorned with skilfully made cherubim) (s:hoihtak) (b:hoihtak) (r:54.3.12/2.4.14/20.27.23/6.23.11/2.26.31)
