hon = (t:n) (w:flock/herd/swarm/troop/group) (d:a group of animals kept or moving together, a swarm of insects, or a band of people) (e:Ngia ~ lakah tuuno kikhahte bangin/kauphe ~ tua banga a tam | so great a swarm of locusts/a ~ lak panin | from the flock/Nangma hangin galkap ~ khat ka sugawpzo a | with your help I can crush a troop/khuai ~ khat le khuaizu na om hi | there was a swarm of bees and honey) (s:ganhon) (r:42.10.3/2.10.14/3.1.10/10.22.30/7.14.8) (q:draft)
