honhon = (t:adv) (w:in groups/in companies) (d:hon group doubled; the sense in this verse is not clear, the NIV has the highways were abandoned) (e:a ~ a, khualzinte om nawn lo a) (r:7.5.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
