iplah = (t:v) (w:spare/hold dear) (d:value something too much to lose it; iplah loin means without sparing, mercilessly) (e:~ loin a kidengkham beel) (r:23.30.14) (q:draft, low confidence)
iplahin = (t:v) (w:coveting/desiring) (d:iplah, covet, with the linking suffix in) (e:tuate ~ ka lakha hi) (b:iplah) (r:6.7.21/6.6.18) (q:draft)
iplahkha = (t:v) (w:lust after/covet/desire) (d:come to desire in the heart; used with kei in as a prohibition) (e:Amau’ melhoihna ~ kei inla) (r:20.6.25) (q:draft, low confidence)
ipna = (t:see) <ipna-in>
