ippi = (t:n) (w:sackcloth/sack) (d:ip bag with pi, big: a large sack; ippi puan is sackcloth, worn in mourning) (e:ahih manin ~ puan silh un la) (b:ip) (r:24.4.8/27.9.3) (q:draft)
ipsung = (t:n) (w:bag/inside of a bag) (d:ip bag with sung, inside) (e:Na ~ uhah tawisuang nam nih) (r:5.25.13) (q:draft)
ipte = (t:n) (w:bags/sacks/purses) (d:ip bag with the plural te; khutkhai ipte, handbags or purses) (e:puanza neute, puanpite leh khutkhai ~) (b:ip) (r:23.3.22/1.42.25) (q:draft)
iptheite = (t:n) (w:those who can hold back) (d:ip hold in, thei be able, with the plural te; pau iptheite are those who can hold their tongue) (e:pau ~ mipil hi) (r:20.10.19) (q:draft)
ipzo = (t:v) (w:restrain/hold back/keep in) (d:ip hold in with zo, be able; of anger or words kept to oneself) (e:mipilte in a hehna uh ~ hi) (b:ip) (r:20.12.16/18.4.2) (q:draft)
ipzote = (t:see) <ki-ipzote>
