khawngin = (t:part) (w:about/around) (d:khawng, approximately, with in, placed after a time: at about that time) (e:nai guk kikal ~ a nungzuite kiang) (b:khawng) (r:41.6.48) (q:draft)
khawngte = (t:part) (w:and the like/such things as) (d:khawng placed after each item of a list of examples, with the plural te after the last item) (e:sumngo kibawl beellekuang ~ sawp ding) (b:khawng) (r:41.7.4) (q:draft)
