khazapna = (t:n) (w:beating of wings/flapping) (d:khazap, wing, with the noun suffix na: the moving of the wings and its sound) (e:huihlakah a ~ le leengpei gingte) (b:khazap) (r:26.3.13) (q:draft, low confidence)
khazel = (t:part) (d:placed after a verb, kha, happen to, with zel, again or in turn: might also come to do) (e:min kong daisak ~ ding hi) (r:20.30.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
khazenzen = (t:adv) (w:by any chance/ever) (d:kha, happen to, with zenzen, by chance; with leh, if it should ever happen that) (e:siatna tung ~ leh) (r:1.42.38) (q:draft)
