kiatna = (t:n) (w:fall/downfall) (d:the act of falling; za kiatna, loss of office; thong kiatna, being put in prison) (e:a ~ ging in minam khempeuh lok gawp) (b:kiat) (r:26.31.16/20.29.16) (q:draft)
