kiatsak = (t:v) (w:cause to fall/bring down/send down) (d:kiat fall with sak causative; thong kiatsak, put in prison; za kiatsak, remove from a position) (e:vantung panin leitung dongin mei a ~ dongin) (b:kiat) (r:66.13.13/24.37.18) (q:draft)
