Kihangsak = (t:v) (w:be strong/be brave/take courage) (d:kihangsak, make oneself brave, at the start of a sentence; Kihangsak in is the command be strong) (e:~ in, i mite ading leh) (b:kihangsak) (r:10.10.12/27.10.19) (q:draft)
