kikhensakzo = (t:v) (w:be able to separate/separate) (d:kikhensak, separate, with zo, be able) (e:tawh hong ~ het lo ding hi) (b:kikhensak) (r:45.8.38/45.8.35) (q:draft)
kikhenta = (t:v) (w:be weaned/be separated) (d:kikhen, be separated, with ta marking a change that has taken place; nawi tawh kikhenta, parted from the breast, is weaned) (e:nawi tawh a ~ naupang bangin) (b:kikhen) (r:19.131.2) (q:draft)
kikhentan = (t:v) (w:be cut off/be parted/be divided) (d:of flowing water, be stopped and separated) (e:Jordan a galkah ciangin Jordan tuite ~ hi) (r:6.4.7) (q:draft)
kikhentat = (t:v) (w:be cut off) (d:of flowing water, be parted and cut off completely) (e:a luangsukte ~ siang hi) (r:6.3.16) (q:draft)
