kikhiam = (t:v) (w:be reduced/be lessened/be diminished) (d:passive of khiam, reduce) (e:nangma sehna zah panin ~ ding hi) (b:khiam) (r:3.27.18/2.5.11) (q:draft)
kikhiamin = (t:v) (w:being diminished/being brought low) (d:kikhiam, be reduced, with the linking suffix in) (e:dahna tawh ~ a kiniamkoih ciangin) (b:kikhiam) (r:19.107.39) (q:draft)
kikhiasuk = (t:v) (w:be thrown down/be hurled down/be cast down) (e:leitungah a ~ hi) (b:khiasuk) (r:66.12.9/9.2.9) (q:draft)
kikhiat = (t:v) (w:be thrown/be cast/be put) (d:be thrown or put into a place such as a prison, a pit or hell; form used before sangin, khit and lam) (e:Thong sungah Johan a ~ khit ciangin) (b:khiat) (r:41.1.14/41.9.45) (q:draft)
