kikiat = (t:v) (w:shave oneself/be shaved) (d:kiat, shave, with the prefix ki; amah le amah a mul kikiat, shave off one's own hair) (e:amah le amah a mul ~ ding a) (b:kiat) (r:3.13.33) (q:draft)
kikiatin = (t:v) (w:be scoured/be scraped) (d:kikiat with the linking ending in; of a metal pot scraped clean before it is rinsed) (e:a beel ~ tui sungah kisawp) (b:kikiat) (r:3.6.28) (q:draft)
kikihta = (t:v) (w:be feared/be dreaded) (d:passive of kihta, fear, with the prefix ki) (e:a nai a gamla ah a ~ mite) (b:kihta) (r:23.18.7) (q:draft)
kikihtakna = (t:n) (w:fear/terror/dread) (d:the fear that others feel toward someone, as the terror of the Lord falling on the nations) (e:minam khempeuh tungah amah ~ tungsak hi) (b:kihtakna) (r:13.14.17/2.23.27) (q:draft)
kikilhna = (t:n) (w:nailing/place of nailing) (d:kilh, nail, with the passive ki and the noun suffix na; a kikilhna mate, the wounds where the nails were driven) (e:siktukkilh tawh a ~ mate mu-in) (r:43.20.25) (q:draft)
kikim = (t:adj) (w:equal/same/alike) (d:of the same size or measure; a ning kikim, with equal sides, means square) (e:a vekpi-in a golna ~ hi) (r:26.46.22/2.28.16) (q:draft)
kikimin = (t:adv) (w:equally/in equal measure) (d:kikim with the ending in; also of the same length as something) (e:a ~ hawm sak in) (b:kikim) (r:4.31.27/5.18.8) (q:draft)
kikimpih = (t:n) (w:equal/peer) (d:kikim, equal, with pih, together with: a person who is on the same level as oneself) (e:ka ~, ka kikholhpih, ka lawm theih mahmah) (b:kikim) (r:19.55.13) (q:draft)
kikimsak = (t:v) (w:make equal/count equal) (d:kikim, equal, with the causative sak; used with tawh for the one to whom someone is made equal) (e:kote tawh na ~ hi) (b:kikim) (r:40.20.12/23.46.5) (q:draft)
kikin = (t:adv) (w:again/back) (d:kik, again or back, with the linking ending in, placed after a verb) (e:khatvei kun ~ a khutme tawh) (b:kik) (r:43.8.8/18.33.30) (q:draft)
kikinah = (t:adv) (w:again/once more) (d:kikin, again, with the ending ah; khatvei kong gen kikinah, once more I tell you) (e:Khatvei kong gen ~) (b:kikin) (r:40.18.19/40.19.24) (q:draft, low confidence)
kikingkalh = (t:todo) (q:draft, describes ornamental work on the temple stands in 1 Kings 7.29, NIV wreaths of hammered work, exact meaning not clear from the verse)
kikip = (t:v) (w:be established/be made firm) (d:kip, be firm, with ki; used with sak, make) (e:leitung ~ sak a) (b:kip) (r:19.93.1) (q:draft)
kikipsak = (t:v) (w:be established/be instituted/be made firm) (d:passive of kipsak with the prefix ki) (e:leitung ~ a, liing ngei lo ding hi) (b:kipsak) (r:19.96.10/4.28.6) (q:draft)
kikipsak = (t:v) (w:build up/strengthen/edify) (d:strengthen each other, with khat leh khat, one another) (e:khat leh khat ~ un) (b:kipsak) (r:52.5.11/45.14.19) (q:draft)
kikipsakin = (t:v) (w:establish oneself/be established) (d:kikipsak, be made firm, with the linking ending in; amahmah kikipsakin, having made himself secure) (e:amahmah Jerusalem ah ~ uk hi) (b:kikipsak) (r:14.12.13) (q:draft)
kikipsakna = (t:n) (w:ordination/confirmation/being established) (e:note hong ~ ni a cin’ mateng) (b:kikipsak) (r:3.8.33/9.3.20) (q:draft)
