kikkikin = (t:adv) (w:again and again/repeatedly) (d:kikkik with the linking suffix in) (e:piaknate pia ~ a ding uh hi) (b:kikkik) (r:58.10.11) (q:draft)
kikna = (t:n) (d:noun form of kik, back or again, joined to a verb: kisik kikna repentance, dawn kikna an answer, gen kikna a saying again) (e:Mawhna kisik ~ tawh kilawm gah) (b:kik) (r:40.3.8/43.12.39) (q:draft)
kiknate = (t:n) (d:plural of kikna, the noun form of kik, back or again, joined to a verb: dawn kiknate, answers) (e:a pilna leh a dawn’ ~) (b:kikna) (r:42.2.47) (q:draft)
kiko = (t:v) (w:crying out) (e:nang tungah kong ~ hi) (r:19.130.1/7.6.7)
kiko = (t:v) (w:out loud) (e:amaute ~-in tai khia uh hi) (r:7.7.21)
