kikoh = (t:v) (w:be reported/be informed) (d:passive of koh, report a matter to someone) (e:thu hong ~ ciangin nangma kiangah) (b:koh) (r:44.23.30) (q:draft)
kikoih = (t:v) (w:be put/be placed/be set/be kept) (e:ama ngawng pen sikkol sungah ~ hi) (b:koih) (r:19.105.18/30.8.1) (q:draft)
