kikoihdak = (t:v) (w:be left/be laid aside) (d:of a thing put somewhere and left there, as a skin bottle left hanging in the smoke) (e:meikhu lak-a a ~ savun-um tawh) (r:19.119.83) (q:draft, low confidence)
