kikte = (t:part) (d:kik, again or back, with the plural te after a verb: those who do the action again or in turn, as in a bangsak kikte, those who restore, and a khang kikte, those who grow up after) (e:a khang ~ in phawk nawn lo) (b:kik) (r:21.1.11/23.58.12) (q:draft)
