kilak = (t:v) (w:appear/show oneself/be shown/be revealed) (e:tawh a pumpi a ~ hi) (b:lak) (r:41.16.12/2.25.40) (q:draft)
kilak = (t:v) (w:be taken/be captured) (e:Jerusalem khua a ~ ciang dong) (b:lak) (r:24.38.28) (q:draft)
