kilamet = (t:v) (w:expect/hope for) (d:lamet, hope or expect, with the prefix ki) (e:An hau dingin na ~ uh hangin) (b:lamet) (r:37.1.9) (q:draft)
kilamin = (t:v) (w:be built/be built up) (d:kilam, be built, with the linking ending in, joining it to the next verb) (e:Tua inn pen suang lianpite tawh ~) (b:kilam) (r:15.5.8/42.21.5) (q:draft)
kilamkik = (t:v) (w:be rebuilt) (d:passive of lamkik rebuild) (e:hih khuapi ~ lo ding hi) (b:lamkik) (r:15.4.21/27.9.25) (q:draft)
