kilamto = (t:v) (w:be raised/be lifted up/be upraised) (d:passive of lamto, lift up; of a hand held up, also of trees standing high) (e:ama khut ~ lai hi) (b:lamto) (r:23.9.12/23.2.13) (q:draft)
