kinelsak = (t:v) (w:be made smooth/be smoothed) (d:nel fine or smooth with the causative sak and passive ki: of rough ground) (e:a leihumte ~ ding hi) (r:42.3.5) (q:draft)
kinem = (t:v) (w:be comforted/be consoled) (d:nem soft, gentle, with the prefix ki: be soothed; kinem zo lo is cannot be comforted) (e:ahih manin ~ zo lo hi) (b:nem) (r:24.31.15/40.2.18) (q:draft)
