kinen = (t:see) <kinen'niamna>
kinen'niamna = (t:n) (w:oppression) (d:being pressed down, passive ki with nen'niam oppress and the noun suffix na) (e:cih leh Israel a ~) (r:12.13.4) (q:draft)
