kinotto = (t:v) (w:be pushed up/be driven up) (d:kinot be pushed, with to upward; paired with kinotsuk, be driven this way and that) (e:hong kinotsuk hong ~ kawikawi hi) (b:kinot) (r:46.4.11) (q:draft)
