kiphelhna = (t:n) (w:defence) (d:kiphelh, clear oneself, with the noun suffix na; mawhna kiphelhna, clearing oneself of a charge) (e:mawhna ~ thu a gen lai takin) (b:kiphelh) (r:44.26.24) (q:draft)
kiphelhzo = (t:v) (w:can be quenched/can be put out) (d:kiphelh, be quenched, with zo, be able; with kei, unquenchable) (e:a mei a ~ kei ding hi) (b:kiphelh) (r:24.17.27) (q:draft)
kiphelin = (t:v) (w:splitting apart/being split) (d:kiphel split apart, with the linking ending in) (e:biakna tau ~ a tunga om vutte) (b:kiphel) (r:11.13.3/11.13.5) (q:draft)
kiphelkeek = (t:v) (w:be demolished/be torn down) (d:passive of phelkeek, tear down; said of altars) (e:Biakna taute ~ ding a) (b:phelkeek) (r:26.6.4) (q:draft)
kiphelkek = (t:v) (w:be demolished/be torn down) (d:passive of phelkek tear down, of altars and buildings) (e:Biakna taute ~ ding a) (b:phelkek) (r:26.6.4/41.13.2) (q:draft)
kiphelkekmang = (t:v) (w:be thrown down/be torn down completely) (d:passive of phelkek, tear down, with mang, away or gone) (e:om nawn loin ~ ding hi) (r:42.21.6) (q:draft)
kiphelkham = (t:v) (w:be split apart/split open) (d:passive of phelkham, split open; said of the ground or the earth) (e:amau’ nuai-ah lei ~ hi) (b:phelkham) (r:4.16.31/23.24.19) (q:draft)
kiphelkhamin = (t:v) (w:be divided/be split apart) (d:kiphelkham with the linking in, being split or divided up) (e:Na gam ~ midang tungah kipia ding a) (b:kiphelkham) (r:30.7.17/11.13.5) (q:draft)
kiphelkhia = (t:v) (w:be thrown down/be torn down/come loose) (d:be taken apart or broken off, of stones of a building or of chains) (e:sikkhau khempeuh a ~ hi) (b:phelkhia) (r:44.16.26/41.13.2) (q:draft)
kiphellah = (t:v) (w:defend oneself/clear oneself) (d:apparently kiphel, defend oneself against a charge, with lah; the verse says there will be nothing to answer for when one is accused) (e:na ~ ding khat beek om lo ding hi) (r:45.3.4) (q:draft, low confidence)
kiphelna = (t:n) (w:defense/clearing of oneself) (d:answering an accusation, usually mawh kiphelna) (e:ka mawh ~ thu kong gen ding hi) (b:kiphel) (r:44.24.10/44.26.2) (q:draft)
kiphelphel = (t:v) (w:keep defending oneself/defend oneself) (d:kiphel, defend oneself, doubled for a repeated action; used with mawhna) (e:ka mawhna uh a ~ bang khatin) (r:47.12.19) (q:draft)
kiphelsa = (t:adj) (w:open/opened) (d:kiphel, be untied or loosed, with the completive suffix sa; said of a scroll that lies open) (e:a om laizial ~ pen va la in) (b:kiphel) (r:66.10.8) (q:draft)
kiphelsak = (t:v) (w:be torn down/be broken down) (d:said of an altar; from kiphel, be taken down, with sak) (e:ama biakna tau a ~ ahi hi) (b:kiphel) (r:7.6.31) (q:draft)
kiphen = (t:v) (w:be opened) (d:passive of phen, open; said of a book or scroll) (e:Laibute zong ~ uh hi) (b:phen) (r:66.20.12/27.7.10) (q:draft)
kiphenin = (t:v) (w:be open/lie open) (d:kiphen, be opened, with the linking ending in; said of a book or scroll) (e:khut sungah ~ a om laibu) (b:kiphen) (r:66.10.8) (q:draft)
kiphiat = (t:v) (w:be swept) (d:be swept clean, said of a house) (e:tua inn awngin, ~ kipuah a) (b:phiat) (r:40.12.44) (q:draft)
kiphiat = (t:v) (w:be annulled/be wiped out/be blotted out) (d:be done away with, said of an agreement or of people) (e:na thuciamna uh ~ ding a) (b:phiat) (r:23.28.18/38.11.14) (q:draft)
kiphiatkhia = (t:v) (w:be wiped out/be blotted out/be swept away) (e:leitung panin amaute ~ hi) (b:phiatkhia) (r:1.7.23/23.48.19) (q:draft)
kiphiatsak = (t:v) (w:be blotted out/be wiped out) (d:kiphiat be wiped out with sak: let them be wiped out, here of names in a book) (e:laibu sung panin amaute ~ in la) (b:kiphiat) (r:19.69.28) (q:draft)
kiphin = (t:v) (w:provoke each other) (d:ki, each other, with phin, provoke) (e:Kuamah kiphasak loin, khatlekhat ~ loin) (b:phin) (r:48.5.26) (q:draft)
kiphitsan = (t:v) (w:be hissed at/be scorned/be scoffed at) (d:passive of phitsan, hiss or scoff at; simmawhna tawh a kiphitsan, an object of scorn) (e:simmawhna tawh a ~ den ding gam) (b:phitsan) (r:24.18.16/24.51.37) (q:draft)
kipho = (t:v) (w:be spread out/be exposed/be laid bare) (d:passive of pho spread out: be laid out in the open where all can see) (e:Pasian mai-ah ~ laakin a om hi) (b:pho) (r:58.4.13/24.8.2) (q:draft)
kiphokhia = (t:v) (w:be exposed/be spread out) (d:kipho, be spread out, with khia, out: be laid out in the open) (e:khempeuh mai-ah a ~ ding hi) (b:kipho) (r:24.8.2) (q:draft)
