kisusiamang = (t:v) (w:be completely destroyed/be wiped out) (d:passive of susiamang, destroy completely) (e:Tua khuapi ~ ding a) (b:susiamang) (r:24.49.2/3.27.29) (q:draft)
kisusiasa = (t:adj) (w:destroyed/broken down/ruined) (d:kisusia with sa, already: that has been destroyed) (e:a ~ kulh kongpi-a pai bangin) (b:kisusia) (r:26.26.10) (q:draft)
kisusiatawm = (t:v) (w:destroy oneself/ruin oneself) (d:susia destroy, with the prefix ki and tawm, by oneself) (e:amau le amau a ~ ahi uh) (r:20.6.32) (q:draft)
kisut = (t:v) (w:be plundered/be robbed) (e:na nate uh hong ~ niloh ding a) (b:sut) (r:5.28.29/36.1.13) (q:draft)
