kitah = (t:v) (w:snap/break) (d:of a thread that parts when fire touches it) (e:mei a suk khak ciangin a ~ bangin) (r:7.16.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
kitahkhak = (t:v) (w:strike against/hit against/dash against) (d:of a foot or a ship and a stone, knock against each other; ends in khak, happen to) (e:Na khete le suang a ~ loh nadingin) (r:19.91.12/44.27.29) (q:draft)
kitai = (t:v) (w:be rebuked/be corrected/admonish one another) (e:~ ding ut lohna in haina hi) (r:20.12.1/51.3.16) (q:draft)
kitaisan = (t:see) <kitaisan-in>
