kobawlna = (t:n) (w:taunt/insult/abuse) (d:kobawl, abuse with words, with the noun suffix na) (e:hong ~ za nawn loin) (r:26.36.15) (q:draft)
koh = (t:v) (w:express/offer/give) (d:say or present something to someone; lungdam koh is to give thanks) (e:Topa tungah lungdam ~ ding hoih hi) (r:14.5.13/19.106.47) (q:draft)
koh = (t:v) (w:report/appeal/bring up) (d:bring a matter or complaint before someone, cry to someone for help) (e:thu dang na ~ nop uh leh) (r:44.19.39/24.36.16) (q:draft)
Kohath = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Kohath) (r:1.46.11/13.6.1)
