kohkhit = (t:v) (w:have given/have offered) (d:koh utter or offer with khit finish; in the verses always lungdamna a kohkhit ciangin, after he had given thanks) (e:lungdamna a ~ ciangin) (r:40.26.27/42.24.30) (q:draft)
kohna = (t:n) (w:telling/announcing/giving notice) (d:act of reporting or expressing, from koh; lungdam kohna is thanksgiving, patau kohna an alarm or warning) (e:Pasian tungah lungdam ~ a makai-in) (b:koh) (r:16.12.46/26.33.5) (q:draft)
koi = (t:adv) (w:where) (e:Na sanggampa Abel ~-ah om ahi hiam) (r:1.4.9/18.21.28)
koiah = (t:adv) (w:where) (d:koi where with ah, at, at what place) (e:tu-in ~ om uh ahi hiam) (b:koi) (r:24.37.19/43.11.34) (q:draft)
koici = (t:adv) (w:how/in what way) (d:question word; with bang, which or what kind) (e:~ gamtat ding cih mihing in) (r:20.20.24/24.5.7) (q:draft)
koih = (t:v) (w:put) (e:keelte a veilam a ~ ding hi) (r:40.25.33/1.42.17) put in a particular position.
koih = (t:v) (w:place) (e:hihtengah na ~ in) (r:1.1.17)
koih = (t:v) (w:deposit)
koih = (t:v) (w:lay down)
koihcing = (t:v) (w:store up/reserve/keep/save) (d:put something by and keep it safe for later use) (e:a hoih leenggahtui tudongin na ~ hi) (r:43.2.10/18.38.23) (q:draft)
koihcip = (t:v) (w:isolate/shut up/keep shut away) (d:koih, put, with cip, tightly closed: put away and keep closed in; also of keeping the hand held back in the fold of the garment) (e:ni sagih sung ~ ding hi) (b:koih) (r:3.13.50/19.74.11) (q:draft)
koihdakna = (t:n) (w:leaving neglected/neglect) (d:the leaving of a thing as it is without caring for it; a siapi-in na koihdakna is your leaving it in ruins) (e:a siapi-in na ~ hang uh ahi hi) (r:37.1.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
koihin = (t:v) (w:put/place/set) (d:koih with the linking suffix in, joining it to the next action) (e:Amah in Beth-el ah khat ~) (b:koih) (r:11.12.29/3.1.7) (q:draft)
koihkhawm = (t:v) (w:put together/join/place with) (d:koih, put, with khawm, together) (e:Judah ciangkhut tawh ka ~ ding hi) (b:koih) (r:26.37.19/1.30.40) (q:draft)
koihkhia = (t:v) (w:put out/remove/take away/get rid of) (d:koih put with khia out) (e:Ka omna panin hih numei ~ in la) (b:koih) (r:10.13.17/12.3.2) (q:draft)
koihkhit = (t:v) (w:have put/finish putting) (d:koih put with khit, finished: the putting is completed) (e:a khenuai-ah a ~ hun dong) (r:46.15.25) (q:draft)
