koihkhong = (t:v) (w:leave alone/let be/leave as is) (d:leave a person as he is without doing anything about it) (e:Hih mi i ~ leh) (r:43.11.48/18.31.17) (q:draft)
koihkik = (t:v) (w:put back/return/restore/replace) (d:koih put with kik again, back) (e:inndei sungah tuate ~ zel uh hi) (b:koih) (r:11.14.28/15.5.15) (q:draft)
