koihleh = (t:v) (w:store/keep) (d:apparently koih, put or store, written together with leh, and: the storing of valuables and) (e:inn van manpha ~ a ki-ap letsong) (r:13.26.20) (q:draft, low confidence)
koihmawk = (t:v) (w:tolerate/let be/leave alone) (d:koih put, leave, with mawk carelessly; with lo, not put up with) (e:le migilote ~ loin) (r:66.2.2) (q:draft)
koihna = (t:n) (w:storehouse/store/holder) (d:place where something is put or kept, as in humpinelkai koihna lions' den and meivak koihna lampstand) (e:ka van ~ sungah kisincip) (b:koih) (r:5.32.34/27.6.19) (q:draft)
koihnate = (t:n) (w:storehouses/treasuries/stores) (d:places where things are kept) (e:inn van manpha ~ a uk ahi) (b:koihna) (r:13.9.26/14.32.28) (q:draft)
koihpa = (t:n) (w:one who appointed/one who put) (d:the man or the one who put, set or appointed someone, koih with pa for a male doer) (e:amah a ~ mai-ah a diktat hi) (b:koih) (r:58.3.2/27.1.11) (q:draft)
