koihsak = (t:v) (w:put for/place for/set up for) (d:koih, put, with sak: put or appoint something for someone, or cause it to be put) (e:ama lungsim sungah a ~ pilna) (b:koih) (r:14.9.23/24.29.15) (q:draft)
koihsakin = (t:v) (w:keep for/set up for) (d:koihsak put for someone with the linking ending in: keeping something for someone, and then the next action follows) (e:hih a lian itna kip ~) (b:koihsak) (r:11.3.6) (q:draft)
koihsim = (t:v) (w:hide/set secretly) (d:koih put with sim, secretly: lay a trap where it is not seen) (e:kei hong siahna-in tehlop ~ uh a) (r:19.140.5) (q:draft)
koihsuk = (t:v) (w:put down/set down/put under) (d:koih put with suk, down) (e:ka nuai-ah mite a ~ Pasian) (b:koih) (r:10.22.48/5.26.10) (q:draft)
koihte = (t:n) (w:those placed/things set aside) (d:people or things that someone has put, stationed, kept or set aside) (e:kulhnei khuapite ah a ~ banah) (b:koih) (r:14.17.19/13.29.3) (q:draft)
koihto = (t:v) (w:put up/set on top/build up) (d:koih put with to, upward: set something up on top of another) (e:tua tungah tausangte ~ a) (b:koih) (r:14.32.5) (q:draft)
