lamin = (t:ppm) (d:lam, side or way, with the suffix in, showing direction, manner or time; a hoih lamin is favourably, nitak lamin is in the evening) (e:adang tuuno khat nitak ~ na pia ding hi) (b:lam) (r:2.29.39/16.13.31) (q:draft)
lamka = (t:n) (w:crossroads/fork in the road/road junction) (d:the place where roads part or meet) (e:~ lai-ah na ding kei ding hi) (r:31.1.14/26.21.21) (q:draft)
lamkabom = (t:n) (w:public square/square/open place) (d:an open place in a town where roads meet and people gather) (e:Mihon omna ~ khempeuh ah) (r:30.5.16/34.2.4) (q:draft)
lamkabomah = (t:n) (w:in the marketplace/in the public square) (d:lamkabom, public square, with the place marker ah) (e:Mihon omna ~ a tu naupang) (b:lamkabom) (r:42.7.32/40.11.16) (q:draft)
lamkabomte = (t:see) <lamkabomte-ah>
lamkabomte-ah = (t:n) (w:in the public squares/in the streets) (d:lamkabom, public square, with plural te and the place marker ah) (e:kongzing leh ~ a tu dingin) (r:38.8.4) (q:draft)
lamkaih = (t:v) (w:guide/lead) (d:lead along the way, lam, way, with kaih, lead) (e:amaute a hehpihpa in amaute ~ ding a) (r:23.49.10) (q:draft)
lamkal = (t:n) (w:way/journey) (d:the stretch between setting out and arriving; lamkal-ah om is be on the way) (e:Amaute ~-ah a om lai takin) (r:10.13.30/12.2.1) (q:draft)
