lamlah = (t:v) (w:guide/counsel/direct) (d:show the way, give guidance or advice; the form of lamlak used before na, ding and nading; lamlah khial is to lead astray) (e:thu ~ siamna leh vangliatna Kha/~ nading zong a | he sought guidance/vankah khat thu dongin a ~ ding | consulting a medium to guide him/note hong ~ khialhna-ah Hezekiah thu ngai kei | do not listen to Hezekiah when he misleads you) (s:lamkaih/makaih) (r:23.11.2/14.20.3/13.10.13/12.18.31) (q:draft)
