lan = (t:n) (w:banner/flag/signal) (d:a flag raised as a signal) (e:minamte’ adingin ~ khat khai ding a/Mual kolh tungah ~ khat khai to un | raise a banner on a bare hilltop/mualte tungah ~ khat hong kilah ciangin | when a banner is raised on the mountains) (s:dial/dialkhai) (r:23.11.12/23.13.2/23.18.3) (q:draft)
lan = (t:adj) (w:lustful/oversexed) (d:of strong sexual desire, said of men and of a stallion; the NIV speaks of large genitals here) (e:A ~ mahmah na veng Izipt mite/a ~ mahmah mi khempeuh ngai pahpah hi | she kept lusting after every very lustful man) (r:26.16.26/26.23.20) (q:draft, low confidence)
