Mualneute = (t:n) (w:hills/small hills) (e:~ tuisuak hi) (b:mualneute) (r:34.1.5) (q:draft)
mualno = (t:n) (w:hill/small hill) (d:mual hill with no small; Areopagas mualno is the hill of the Areopagus, Mars Hill) (e:Areopagas ~ tungah a paipih khit uh ciangin) (b:mual) (r:44.17.19/44.17.22) (q:draft)
