muang = (t:v) (w:trust/rely on/hope in) (e:nangmah ka hong ~ hi) (r:19.56.3/45.2.17) (q:draft)
muanga = (t:adj) (w:secure/at ease/unafraid) (d:muang with the linking a; lung muanga, with the heart at rest) (e:a note lung ~ a omna mun) (b:muang) (r:34.2.11) (q:draft)
muangin = (t:v) (w:trusting/trusting in/relying on) (d:muang, trust, with the linking ending in: trusting, and so; lung muangin is with a secure heart) (e:Mite in a hauhna uh ~) (b:muang) (r:19.49.6/24.17.7) (q:draft)
muangkha = (t:v) (w:trust/depend on/rely on) (d:muang trust with kha, which marks an action one falls into: come to put trust in, often wrongly) (e:na galkap tamna uh ~ na hih manun) (r:28.10.13/23.36.15) (q:draft)
muanglah = (t:v) (w:doubt/lack trust) (d:muang trust with lah, be short of: be unsure, waver) (e:A ~ mite pen huih nunna lam) (r:59.1.6) (q:draft)
muangngam = (t:v) (w:trust confidently/dare to trust) (d:muang trust with ngam dare) (e:a hong ciam thu ~ ihih manin) (r:58.10.23) (q:draft)
muangpa = (t:n) (w:one who trusts) (d:muang trust, with pa marking a man: the man who trusts) (e:a ~ in mi lungdam ahi hi) (b:muang) (r:19.146.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
muangsak = (t:v) (w:cause to trust/let trust) (d:muang trust with sak cause: make or let someone rely on; said of widows who may depend on God) (e:numeite uh zong kei hong ~ un) (b:muang) (r:24.49.11) (q:draft)
muangte = (t:n) (w:those who trust) (d:muang with plural te: people who trust or hope in someone) (e:Topa a ~ ahih leh itna kip in) (b:muang) (r:19.32.10/19.115.8) (q:draft)
