muanhuai = (t:adj) (w:fortified/secure/strong) (d:safe to rely on, said of a place; mun muanhuai is a stronghold and khuapi muanhuai a fortified city) (e:mun ~ sungah David om hi) (r:13.11.16/23.2.15) (q:draft)
muanhuai = (t:adj) (w:trustworthy/reliable) (d:said of a person or thing that can be trusted) (e:a ~ mi leh sumgolh a mudah mi) (r:2.18.21/20.11.13) (q:draft)
