muanhuainna = (t:n) (w:stronghold/fortress) (d:secure place; apparently a spelling of muanhuaina, which stands earlier in the same verse) (e:Izipt gam mun ~ sunga om mite) (r:30.3.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
muanhuaipen = (t:adj) (w:most secure/strongest) (d:muanhuai secure, with the superlative pen: the most strongly fortified) (e:khuapi ~ ahi Pelusium khuapi) (b:muanhuai) (r:26.30.15) (q:draft)
