muanhuaite = (t:adj) (w:trustworthy/reliable) (d:plural of muanhuai said of people who can be relied on, here of allies) (e:Lot suan-le-khakte’ pawl ~ ahi uh hi) (b:muanhuai) (r:19.83.8) (q:draft, low confidence)
muanin = (t:v) (w:trust/depend on/rely on) (d:in muanin nei, have as one's trust, put one's trust in) (e:Mihingte ~ nei nawn kei un) (b:muan) (r:23.2.22/33.5.7) (q:draft)
muanlah = (t:v) (w:doubt/waver/distrust) (d:be unable to trust, be in doubt, from muan trust) (e:Pasian’ thuciamna ~ dingin ngaihsun lo a) (r:45.4.20/40.14.31) (q:draft)
