oloes = (t:n) (c:plant) (w:aloes) (d:a fragrant substance used as perfume) (e:~ paknamtui leh kinnamon paknamtui tawh) (r:20.7.17) (q:draft)
olsak = (t:v) (w:make common/make plentiful) (d:ol, easy, with the causative sak; make a thing easy to get, as common as stones) (e:suang bangin ngun ~ a) (b:ol) (r:11.10.27/14.1.15) (q:draft)
oltak = (t:adv) (w:easily/at ease) (d:ol, easy, with tak making an adverb; oltak a nuntakna is a life of ease, rest) (e:Hih minamte lakah ~ a nuntakna na mu kei) (b:ol) (r:5.28.65/20.13.11) (q:draft)
