omkhak = (t:v) (w:happen to be/chance to be) (d:form of omkha used before leh, loh and pen: be or exist by chance, mostly in if-clauses and warnings) (e:a phamawh a ~ zenzen leh) (b:omkha) (r:15.7.20/58.3.12) (q:draft)
omkhawm = (t:v) (w:be with/stay together/live together) (e:Nungzuite tawh sawtpi a ~ uh hi) (b:om) (r:44.14.28/19.73.23) (q:draft)
omkhawmin = (t:v) (w:be with/stay with/live with) (d:omkhawm with the linking ending in: being together with someone, tawh marks the companion) (e:tu-in note tawh ~ ka kam pauna) (b:omkhawm) (r:48.4.20/43.14.17) (q:draft)
omkhawmna = (t:n) (w:being together/standing together) (d:omkhawm, be together, with the noun suffix na) (e:kiptakin na ~ uh ka theih manin) (b:omkhawm) (r:51.2.5) (q:draft)
omkhawmsak = (t:v) (w:cause to be with/put together with) (d:omkhawm, be together, with sak, cause: make or let someone be in the same place as others) (e:misimtatte tawh a ~ ding hi) (b:omkhawm) (r:40.24.51/43.17.24) (q:draft)
omkhawmte = (t:n) (w:companions/those who are with) (d:omkhawm, be together, with plural -te: those who are with someone) (e:amah tawh a ~ a lusu uh hi) (b:omkhawm) (r:42.9.32/44.20.34) (q:draft)
omkhin = (t:v) (w:have already been/already exist) (d:om be with khin already, finished: have been somewhere or in a state up to now, was already there before) (e:ni thum bang hong ~ uh a) (b:om) (r:41.8.2/43.1.30) (q:draft)
omkhit = (t:v) (w:have been/have stayed) (d:om, be or stay, with khit, finished; mostly as omkhit ciangin, after being or staying) (e:kha thum ka ~ uh ciangin) (r:44.28.11/46.15.46) (q:draft)
omkhitna = (t:n) (w:having been) (d:omkhit, have been, with the noun suffix na: the fact of having been something for a time) (e:thukhenin sauveipi na ~ thu) (b:omkhit) (r:44.24.10) (q:draft)
omkhol = (t:v) (w:be ready/be prepared) (d:om, be, with khol, beforehand: be in readiness for what is to be done) (e:sihna nangawn thuak dingin ka ~ hi) (r:44.21.13/44.23.15) (q:draft)
omkhong = (t:v) (w:stay still/keep still/be at rest) (d:in the verses always negated with thei lo: cannot keep still, restless) (e:peengkul a kitum ciangin ~ thei lo uh hi) (r:18.39.24/59.3.8) (q:draft)
