omkik = (t:v) (w:be again/happen again/exist again) (d:om be with kik, again or back: return to an earlier state; with lo, be no more) (e:Tua ciangin gal hong ~ hi) (b:om) (r:9.19.8/66.22.3) (q:draft)
omkim = (t:v) (w:be all present/be everywhere) (d:om be with kim complete: all are there, or be present throughout a place) (e:mun khempeuhah a ~ khit theih nadingin) (r:49.4.10/9.16.11) (q:draft)
