omlaite = (t:n) (w:the rest/remnant/those remaining) (d:the people or things that are left; in Kings, the remaining acts of a reign) (e:Jakob innkuan a ~ a vanglian Pasian) (b:omlai) (r:23.10.21/12.16.19) (q:draft)
