ommah = (t:v) (w:indeed be/be just so) (d:om, be, with mah for emphasis: a ommah ding is there must indeed be, a ommah bangin is just as one was) (e:kikhenna a ~ ding ahi hi) (b:om) (r:46.11.19/28.2.3) (q:draft, low confidence)
ommawk = (t:v) (w:be idle/do nothing/stay still/delay) (d:remain without acting or speaking; ommawk kei in warns not to neglect or put off a duty) (e:gen ding thei nawn loin ~ uh hi) (r:18.32.16/15.4.22) (q:draft)
