phu = (t:n) (w:vengeance/revenge) (d:mostly in phu la, to take vengeance, to avenge) (e:hehna tawh ~ ka la ding hi) (r:33.5.15/4.35.19) (q:draft)
phu = (t:v) (w:push against/press against/head into) (e:a muh ciangin phung ~ a) (r:4.22.25/44.27.15) (q:draft)
