piantheih = (t:v) (w:can happen/be possible/can come about) (d:pian come into being, with theih, be able) (e:hih thu bangci ~ ding ahi hiam) (b:pian) (r:42.1.34/45.4.18) (q:draft)
pianuam = (t:v) (w:want to give/be willing to give) (d:pia, give, with nuam, want) (e:go-in pakkualte a ~ uh hi) (r:44.14.13/62.3.17) (q:draft)
