pianzawh = (t:v) (w:have come into being/have happened) (d:pian, come into being, with zawh, finished: used for the time since something began or happened, as in mihing a pianzawh, since mankind came to be) (e:mihing a ~ hih bang zinling) (r:66.16.18/42.24.21) (q:draft, low confidence)
pianzia = (t:n) (w:nature/appearance/form/character) (d:the way something is made or looks) (e:Tua leengpeite a ~ kibang kim a) (r:26.10.10/40.7.20) (q:draft)
