piasak = (t:v) (w:cause to give/let give/have someone give) (d:pia give with the causative sak: make or allow someone to give, or have a thing given) (e:nasemte tungah a sum ~ in) (b:pia) (r:12.22.5/9.25.27) (q:draft)
