puktheihna = (t:n) (w:stumbling/cause of stumbling) (d:puktheih can stumble with the noun suffix na; puktheihna ding suangtum, a stone that makes people stumble) (e:mite’ ~ ding suangtum tawh kibang hi) (b:puktheih) (r:23.8.14) (q:draft)
pul = (t:n) (w:plague/pestilence) (d:deadly disease that spreads among many people, also in pul natna) (e:kial leh ~ hong tung ding hi) (r:42.21.11/24.42.17) (q:draft)
Pul = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Pul) (d:king of Assyria, also called Tiglath-Pileser) (e:Assiria kumpipa ~ tua gam do dingin) (r:12.15.19/13.5.26) (q:draft)
Pul = (t:n) (w:plague/pestilence) (d:pul, plague, with a capital at the start of a sentence; pul natna, a deadly epidemic disease) (e:~ natna tawh amaute vat gawpin) (b:pul) (r:4.14.12) (q:draft)
