siampite = (t:n) (w:prophets) (b:siampi) plural form of <siampi>
siampte = (t:n) (w:priests) (d:apparently a misprint of siampite, priests) (e:No ~ in kei hong simmawh napi-in) (r:39.1.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
