siamzawk = (t:adj) (w:more skilled/better) (d:form of siamzaw, more skilled, used before lam and na) (e:a zah sawmin a ~ lam uh a mu hi) (b:siamzaw) (r:27.1.20) (q:draft)
siamzawklam = (t:n) (w:being more skilled/superiority in skill) (d:siamzawk, more skilled, with lam: the fact or extent of being more skilled) (e:a zah sawmin a ~ uh a mu hi) (r:27.1.20) (q:draft)
