taktakah = (t:adv) (w:in the very/truly in) (d:taktak, truly, with the place marker ah; lungsim tawng taktakah is in the very depth of the heart) (e:Ka lungsim tawng ~ Pasian’ thukham) (b:taktak) (r:45.7.22) (q:draft)
taktakin = (t:adv) (w:truly/really/indeed/in fact) (d:taktak with -in, usually as a taktakin) (e:a ~ amah in ka sanggamnu mah) (b:taktak) (r:1.20.12/23.45.15) (q:draft)
taktakna = (t:n) (w:genuineness/sincerity/reality) (d:taktak, truly, with na, placed after a verb or adjective to make a noun: the fact of truly doing or being so, as in it taktakna, true love, and lungkim taktakna, full conviction) (e:note ka hong it ~ thu) (b:taktak) (r:50.1.8/52.1.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
taktakpa = (t:n) (w:the true one/the real one) (d:taktak, truly, with pa, the man who: after a verb, the one who truly does it, as a nei taktakpa, the true owner) (e:amah a hu ~ ahihna Pasian in) (b:taktak) (r:19.48.3/18.31.38) (q:draft)
taktakta = (t:adv) (w:truly now/really) (d:taktak, truly, with ta, marking that a new state has come) (e:bei nading nai ~ hi) (b:taktak) (r:62.2.18) (q:draft)
taktakte = (t:adj) (w:true/real/genuine) (d:taktak with the plural suffix te, the true or real ones, after a verb those who truly do it, as in a bia taktakte, the true worshipers) (e:a hiang ~ pammaih a sak kei leh) (b:taktak) (r:45.11.21/43.4.23) (q:draft)
takte = (t:part) (d:the strengthening particle tak followed by the plural te, which makes the phrase before it mean those who or the things that, as in a taisuak dek takte, those who are just escaping) (e:a taisuak dek ~ tungah) (b:tak) (r:61.2.18/66.2.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
takteng = (t:n) (w:good grain/sound grain) (d:the full grain, all of it, as against a siteng, the chaff; ends in teng, all) (e:a ~ ansal sungah koihin) (r:42.3.17) (q:draft, low confidence)
takun = (t:conj) (w:while/when) (d:tak with the plural ending un, in lai takun, at the very time when they) (e:a om lai ~ a suah hun tung a) (b:tak) (r:42.2.6/44.8.36) (q:draft)
tal = (t:n) (w:carrying frame/frame) (d:frame on which a load is laid to be carried) (e:a puak nading ~ tungah koih) (r:4.4.10/4.4.12) (q:draft)
tal = (t:n) (w:forehead) (d:the forehead, tal kolh is a bald forehead) (e:amah a ~ kolh hi a) (r:3.13.41) (q:draft)
tal = (t:adj) (w:male) (d:male of an animal, written after the animal name, as in la-tal, a male donkey, and bawng-tal, a bull) (r:1.12.16/1.32.5) (q:draft)
talap = (t:n) (w:colonnade/porch) (d:a covered walk beside a pool) (e:tua bual kimkotah ~ nga a om) (r:43.5.2) (q:draft)
