talen = (t:n) (w:talent) (d:a large unit of weight for gold and silver) (e:Kham citak ~ khat tawh) (r:2.25.39/11.9.14) (q:draft)
taleng = (t:conj) (w:even if/even though/although) (d:placed after the verb and often followed by zong: even if, though it be so; alone it can also express a wish, if only) (e:tuipimong pek-ah om ~ zong) (r:19.139.9/19.69.11) (q:draft)
talin = (t:adv) (d:placed after kai, drag: dragged along the ground) (e:kongpi pualamah kikai ~ kipaai ding) (r:24.22.19) (q:draft, low confidence)
