thumin = (t:adv) (w:in three/into three) (d:thum, three, with the marker in; pawl thumin khen, divide into three groups; a thumin, all three) (e:mihing zathumte pawl ~ khenin) (b:thum) (r:7.7.16/5.19.3) (q:draft)
