tungta = (t:v) (w:has arrived/has come) (d:tung with ta, showing that the time or event has now come) (e:A beina hong ~ hi) (b:tung) (r:26.7.6/26.7.10) (q:draft)
tungtang = (t:n) (w:matter/concern) (d:with ah or a possessor: concerning, over, about; kei tungtang ah, over me, about me) (e:kei ~ ah lungdam kei un) (r:33.7.8/1.26.21) (q:draft)
tungtangah = (t:prep) (w:concerning/about/over/because of) (d:tungtang, matter, with the place marker ah, placed after the noun, in the matter of) (e:tua ~ amaute kitawng lo uh hi) (b:tungtang) (r:1.26.22/4.16.49) (q:draft)
