tungtawn = (t:prep) (w:through/by means of) (d:placed after a noun; upna tungtawn is through faith) (e:Khazih Zeisu sunga upna ~ a) (r:55.3.14) (q:draft)
tungtawnin = (t:prep) (w:through/by means of) (d:follows the noun, by the agency of a person) (e:Pasian in Paul’ ~ nalamdang lianpipi) (r:44.19.11/39.1.1) (q:draft)
tungte = (t:n) (w:tops/heights) (d:plural of tung in the sense top or upper surface; mual tungte ah is on the mountains) (e:Israel mual ~ ah a hawkna) (b:tung) (r:26.19.9/23.13.4) (q:draft)
