upin = (t:v) (w:trust/believe) (d:up believe with the suffix in; thu upin nei is hold what someone says as trustworthy, put trust in) (e:thu ~ nei kei inla) (b:up) (r:33.7.5) (q:draft)
Upkhialh = (t:n) (w:wrong belief/doubt) (d:up, believe, with khialh, err; upkhialh lungsim is apparently a doubting or mistaken mind) (e:~ lungsim nei kei un) (r:42.12.30) (q:draft, low confidence)
upkhialhna = (t:n) (w:doubt/unbelief/wavering) (d:up, believe, with khialh, go wrong, and na) (e:a tawp dongin ~ nei loin) (r:58.6.11/59.1.6) (q:draft)
uplahna = (t:n) (w:doubt/unbelief) (d:the state of doubting or not believing, the opposite of upna faith; uplahna lungsim is an unbelieving heart) (e:Note in ~ nei hetloin) (r:40.21.21/41.11.23) (q:draft)
uploh = (t:v) (w:not believe/disbelieve) (d:up, the form of um believe used before a suffix, with loh not: not believing, unbelief; a uploh manin, because they did not believe) (e:Amaute in amah a ~ manin) (r:41.6.6/43.16.9) (q:draft)
upmanin = (t:adv) (w:because of believing/through faith) (d:up believe with man, reason, and in: because one believes) (e:i ~ Pasian’ vangliatna in) (r:60.1.5) (q:draft)
upmawh = (t:v) (w:suppose/expect/suspect/think) (d:believe something to be so without being sure) (e:a zi a ~ ciangin) (r:4.5.30/44.25.18) (q:draft)
upmawhna = (t:n) (w:suspicion/jealousy) (d:suspicion of wrongdoing, in the verses a husband's jealous suspicion of his wife) (e:a pasal in ~ lungsim nei-in) (b:upmawh) (r:4.5.14/4.5.25) (q:draft)
upmawhnate = (t:see) <ki-upmawhnate>
upmawhzah = (t:n) (w:as much as expected/amount supposed) (d:upmawh suppose or expect with zah, amount; na upmawhzah sangun is than you expected) (e:na ~ sangun an na tawmzaw) (r:37.2.19) (q:draft, low confidence)
upna = (t:n) (w:faith/belief) (e:~ tawh ka nungta uh hi) (b:up) (r:47.5.7/58.11.2) (q:draft)
upnate = (t:n) (w:beliefs/faith) (d:upna belief with the plural te; a thu upnate uh is the things they believe, their faith) (e:a thu ~ uh ka khawlsak hi) (b:upna) (r:44.26.11) (q:draft)
upnop = (t:v) (w:be willing to believe/be willing to accept) (d:up believe with nop, be willing) (e:Tua thu kigensa na ~ uhleh) (r:40.11.14) (q:draft)
uppa = (t:n) (w:the one believed/the one trusted) (d:up believe with pa, male person: he in whom one believes) (e:ka ~ ka thei a) (b:up) (r:55.1.12) (q:draft)
uppih = (t:v) (w:believe together with/share faith with) (d:up believe with pih together with; thu uppih mi, fellow believer) (e:thu ~ mite na it unla) (b:up) (r:60.2.17/53.3.15) (q:draft)
upsa = (t:v) (w:believed/convinced of) (d:up believe with sa already: what one has come to believe) (e:na theihsa na ~ thute ah kip) (b:up) (r:55.3.14) (q:draft)
uptheih = (t:v) (w:be able to believe/can believe/may believe) (d:up believe with theih can; mostly as uptheih nading, so that someone may believe) (e:Amah ka ~ nadingin amah kua ahi hiam) (b:up) (r:43.9.36/44.15.7) (q:draft)
upzawh = (t:v) (w:be able to believe/come to believe) (d:up believe with zawh, form of zo be able, used before nading) (e:thu a ~ nadingun nakpitakin a gen hi) (r:44.19.8) (q:draft)
