zahtakte = (t:n) (w:those who fear/worshippers) (d:zahtak with plural te, those who fear or revere; mostly Topa a zahtakte, those who fear the Lord) (e:Topa a ~ aw, Topa phat un) (b:zahtak) (r:19.135.20/19.118.4) (q:draft)
