zingciang = (t:adv) (w:tomorrow/the next day) (d:also the day after an event: a zingciang ni) (e:tu ni leh ~ sung teng) (r:2.19.10/6.5.11) (q:draft)
zingciangin = (t:adv) (w:tomorrow/the next day/the next morning) (d:zingciang, tomorrow, with the suffix in; a zingciangin is on the following day) (e:a ~ Khios tuikulh kiangah ka tung) (b:zingciang) (r:44.20.15/59.4.14) (q:draft)
zinggawp = (t:v) (w:grow utterly dark) (d:zing dark or cloudy, with gawp thoroughly: khim zinggawp, darkness falls completely) (e:khuapi-ah khim ~ ding a) (b:zing) (r:26.30.18) (q:draft)
zingin = (t:v) (w:be dark/be gloomy) (d:zing dark or cloudy, with the linking suffix in: khua zingin, the day being dark) (e:khua ~ mai mial ni) (b:zing) (r:36.1.15) (q:draft)
zingsak = (t:v) (w:darken/make dark) (d:zing dark, cloudy, with causative sak) (e:leitung khim a ~ hi) (b:zing) (r:19.105.28/19.18.11) (q:draft)
zingsang = (t:n) (w:morning) (e:A ~ ciangin Topa in kei kiangah) (r:26.12.8/1.1.19)
