zintunna = (t:n) (w:lodging/place of stay) (d:the place where a traveller stays as a guest; before inn, mun or pa it means the house, the place or the host where one is staying) (e:ka ~ inn-ah hong tung uh hi) (b:zintun) (r:44.11.11/45.16.23) (q:draft)
zinzin = (t:v) (w:travel about/journey) (d:zin travel, doubled for going on and on or from place to place; used with khual, away from home) (e:amah tawh khual a ~ khawm ngei mite) (r:44.13.31) (q:draft)
zinzinna = (t:n) (w:travels/journeying) (d:zinzin travel about, with the noun suffix na) (e:Khual ka ~ lamin tuikhang lauhuaina) (b:zinzin) (r:47.11.26) (q:draft)
