zom = (t:v) (w:join/attach/fasten) (d:join one thing to another) (e:khau mong nihte ~ uh hi) (r:2.39.18) (q:draft)
zom = (t:n) (w:next/second) (d:the one that comes next in place, order or rank; ama zom-ah means next to him or after him) (e:Ama ~-ah phual a sat dingte) (r:4.2.27/9.23.17) (q:draft)
