zomsak = (t:v) (w:let continue/make continue) (d:zom continue, with causative sak) (e:a nuntakna haksa mah ~ hoh in) (b:zom) (r:18.14.6) (q:draft)
zomsuak = (t:v) (w:continue/keep on/carry through) (d:zom, continue, with suak, through: go on with something without stopping, carry it through to the end) (e:na ki-itna uh na ~ un) (r:58.13.1/47.8.11) (q:draft)
zomto = (t:v) (w:carry on/continue/keep up) (d:zom, continue, with to, onward: carry on what others began; innkuan zomto is carry on a family line) (e:i pu i pate’ maban ~ vet un) (b:zom) (r:40.23.32/5.25.9) (q:draft)
zomzom = (t:v) (w:go on and on/continue) (d:zom continue, doubled for an action that keeps going) (e:Paul in a thugen ~ ahih manin) (r:44.20.9) (q:draft)
zomzomsak = (t:v) (w:let go on/let continue) (d:zomzom go on and on, with causative sak) (e:a nuntak haksapi mah ~ hoh in) (b:zomzom) (r:18.14.6) (q:draft)
zon = (t:v) (w:seek/search/look for) (d:form of zong used before a suffix or another word, usually written with a final apostrophe) (e:~’ hun om a, mansuah hun om hi) (r:21.3.6/14.12.14) (q:draft)
zong = (t:adv) (w:also) (e:Zingsol ~ amah ka pia ding hi) (r:66.2.28/42.23.36)
zong = (t:adv) (w:in addition)
zong = (t:adv) (w:too)
zong = (t:adv) (w:as well)
zong = (t:v) (w:look) (e:Topa leh ama hatna ~ un la) (r:13.16.11) looking for something such as a job or an object
zonga = (t:v) (w:seek/look for) (d:zong seek, with the linking a: i zonga, we sought and; not the adverb zong, also) (e:Nopna i ~ nopna hong pai lo hi) (r:24.8.15) (q:draft)
zongin = (t:conj) (w:although/but) (e:Ahi ~ tu-in na ngah dinga) (r:18.36.17/24.2.22)
zongkhia = (t:v) (w:search out/track down/find) (d:zong seek, with khia out) (e:amah ka ~ teitei ding hi) (b:zong) (r:9.23.23) (q:draft)
zongkik = (t:v) (w:seek again/look for again) (d:zong seek, with kik again) (e:lampi mah limtakin ~ un) (b:zong) (r:24.31.21/46.7.27) (q:draft)
zongpa = (t:n) (w:seeker/one who seeks/searcher) (d:zong seek with pa, the one who does it: he who seeks or searches) (e:Lungsim sung a ~ in Kha Siangtho’ lungsim) (b:zong) (r:45.8.27/20.19.8) (q:draft)
zongpah = (t:v) (w:seek at once/begin to look for) (d:zong seek, with pah at once, straight away) (e:hunhoih a ~ hi) (r:40.26.16) (q:draft)
zongpahin = (t:v) (w:seek at once/look for straight away) (d:zongpah seek at once, with the linking suffix in) (e:a u Simon ~ ama kiangah) (b:zongpah) (r:43.1.41) (q:draft)
zongpak = (t:v) (w:hurry to seek/seek quickly) (d:zong seek, with pak quickly) (e:bukna ka ~ ding hi) (r:19.55.8) (q:draft)
zongsak = (t:v) (w:order a search/have someone search for/cause to seek) (d:zong seek with sak cause: have someone look for a person or thing; mawhna zongsak, have charges brought) (e:Herod in amah ~ a) (b:zong) (r:44.12.19/17.2.2) (q:draft)
zongsang = (t:v) (w:be accustomed/be used to/make a habit of) (d:be practised in something or given to it through constant doing) (e:siatna bawl ding a ~ khin note) (r:24.13.23/62.3.6) (q:draft)
zongsatna = (t:n) (w:habit/addiction/depravity) (d:something a person has grown used to and is mastered by; here of evil habits that bring ruin) (e:siatna a piangsak thei ~ lelin) (r:61.2.19) (q:draft, low confidence)
zongtawm = (t:v) (w:forage/search for) (d:zong seek, with tawm by oneself: look for what one needs wherever it can be found) (e:a an ding uh ~ uh a) (r:18.24.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
zongte = (t:n) (w:those who seek/seekers) (d:zong seek with plural te; the people who look for or try to get someone or something) (e:nangmah hong ~ nusia lo na hih manin) (r:19.9.10/19.70.4) (q:draft)
zongun = (t:conj) (w:even though/although/even if) (d:zong even, also, with un for a plural subject, closing a clause) (e:lungkhauh mite ka hita ~) (b:zong) (r:2.34.9/24.15.1) (q:draft)
zongzaw = (t:v) (w:seek rather/seek instead/seek all the more) (d:zong, seek, with zaw, rather or more) (e:midangte’ phattuam nading ~ un) (b:zong) (r:46.10.24/24.38.4) (q:draft)
zongzong = (t:v) (w:keep seeking/look for/search for) (d:zong seek said twice, for seeking that goes on or is done persistently) (e:Bang ~ na hi hiam) (r:1.37.15/20.16.27) (q:draft)
zonkhiatsak = (t:v) (w:search out for/find for) (d:zon seek, with khiat out and sak for another: search out something for someone) (e:amaute a dingin ka ~) (r:26.20.6) (q:draft)
zonkik = (t:v) (w:seek again/return to seek) (d:zon seek, with kik again, back) (e:kei hong ~ mateng) (b:zon) (r:28.5.15) (q:draft)
zonna = (t:n) (w:seeking/search) (d:the act of seeking or looking for something; with ding, a means or purpose of seeking) (e:pilna ~ ding sum tampi) (b:zon) (r:20.17.16/12.5.7) (q:draft)
zonpih = (t:v) (w:help look for/seek together with) (d:zon seek, with pih together with) (e:Amah hong ~ nung) (b:zon) (r:22.6.1) (q:draft)
zonsak = (t:v) (w:seek for/find for/provide) (d:zon seek with sak, here doing it for someone else: look for and get something on behalf of another) (e:amaute a dingin zi zong a ~ hi) (b:zon) (r:14.11.23/26.34.15) (q:draft)
zontheih = (t:v) (w:be able to seek/can seek) (d:zon, seek, with theih, can, the form used before nading: so that one can seek or find) (e:na min hong ~ nadingin) (b:zon) (r:19.83.16/45.1.20) (q:draft)
zonzaw = (t:v) (w:seek more/search for rather) (d:zon seek, with zaw more: seek one thing more than another) (e:sih ding a lim ~) (b:zon) (r:18.3.21) (q:draft)
zonzon = (t:v) (w:keep searching/search and search/look for) (d:zon, form of zong seek, doubled to show continued or repeated searching) (e:ka ~ hangin ka mu zo kei hi) (r:22.3.2/19.37.36) (q:draft)
zop = (t:v) (w:carry on/continue) (d:form of zom join or continue used before ding, zawh and nading; to carry on a name or go on with a work; zop zawh is be able to carry through, to finish) (e:inn a ~ zawh kei leh) (r:42.14.29/5.25.7) (q:draft)
zop = (t:v) (w:share in/join in) (d:to be joined to something and so have a part in it) (e:eite in i ~ nadingin) (r:58.12.10) (q:draft, low confidence)
zopa = (t:n) (w:one who is able/he who can) (d:zo be able with pa, the one who: follows a verb, as honkhia zopa, the one who is able to save) (e:sihna pan a honkhia ~ kiangah) (r:58.5.7/40.10.28) (q:draft)
zopa = (t:n) (w:conqueror/victor/one who subdues) (d:zo win or defeat with pa: the one who defeated or subdues) (e:Moab gam sungah Midian a ~) (b:zo) (r:13.1.46/19.144.2) (q:draft)
zopna = (t:n) (w:sharing/partnership/fellowship) (d:zop join or share in, with the noun suffix na) (e:Upna na ~ a vanglian-in) (b:zop) (r:57.1.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
zoppihte = (t:n) (d:zop join, with pih together with and the plural te: those joined with one; laigui zoppihte, those of the same umbilical cord, are brothers born of the same mother) (e:ka sanggam, ka laigui ~ ahi uh hi) (r:7.8.19) (q:draft, low confidence)
zoptheih = (t:v) (w:be able to continue) (d:zop continue, with theih be able; used before nading) (e:a khualzinna uh nuamtakin a ~ nadingun) (b:zop) (r:64.1.6/46.16.11) (q:draft)
Zorah = (t:name) (c:land) (w:Zorah) (r:6.19.41/16.11.29)
zosak = (t:v) (w:bring to completion/make complete) (d:zo finish, with causative sak) (e:hong ~ ding hi ci-in ka lungkim hi) (b:zo) (r:50.1.6) (q:draft)
zosak = (t:v) (w:give victory over/make win) (d:zo win, with causative sak) (e:na galte khempeuh ka hong ~ hi) (b:zo) (r:10.7.9) (q:draft)
zosakhi = (t:n) (c:animal) (w:antelope/ibex) (d:a clean wild animal of the deer or goat kind, named in a list beside sakhi deer; which animal is meant is not certain) (e:sathak, saza, ~, le gamtuu ahi hi) (r:5.14.5) (q:draft, low confidence)
zosiang = (t:v) (w:finish/complete) (d:zo finish, with siang clean: bring a matter fully to an end) (e:hih thu na ~ un) (b:zo) (r:47.8.11) (q:draft)
zota = (t:v) (d:zo be able, finish, with ta marking a change now complete, placed after another verb: has now come to pass, have now managed to) (e:a minthanna teng a maimang ~ hi) (b:zo) (r:25.1.6/19.131.2) (q:draft, low confidence)
zote = (t:n) (w:those who are able/those who manage) (d:zo be able or succeed with plural -te, after a verb: those who manage to do it, as a thuak zote, those who endure) (e:A tawp dongin a thuak ~ in) (b:zo) (r:41.13.13/20.18.22) (q:draft)
zothawhin = (t:v) (w:overpower/get the better of) (d:zo overcome, with thawh and the linking suffix in) (e:Mite in kote hong ~ gamlakah) (r:10.11.23) (q:draft, low confidence)
Zozabad = (t:name) (w:Jozabad) (r:16.11.16)
zozaw = (t:v) (w:prevail/overcome/triumph) (d:zo win with zaw more: be the stronger, get the upper hand) (e:Topa’ vangliatna in kei hong ~ hi) (b:zo) (r:26.3.14/59.2.13) (q:draft)
zozaw = (t:v) (w:be more able/can all the more) (d:after a verb, zo be able with zaw more: be able to do it even more, how much more) (e:kihel khawm kuaitan ~ ding ahi hiam) (r:24.15.12/58.9.14) (q:draft, low confidence)
zozo = (t:v) (w:overcome/prevail/tame) (d:reduplicated zo, win or be able; with a negative, cannot manage at all) (e:lunghimawh kei un, leitung ka ~ hi) (b:zo) (r:43.16.33/59.3.8) (q:draft)
zu = (t:n) (w:wine/strong drink/beer) (d:fermented drink, alcohol) (e:kham theih ~ nek a hatte) (r:23.5.22/20.23.30) (q:draft)
zu = (t:v) (w:fall/rain) (d:of rain, fall; guah zu, it rains) (e:leitungah guah ~ hi) (r:1.7.12) (q:draft)
zuahzuah = (t:adv) (w:freely/generously/lavishly) (d:placed after a verb of giving or distributing: give out widely without holding back) (e:Amah in hawmkhia ~ a) (r:19.112.9/47.9.9) (q:draft)
zuahzuahte = (t:n) (w:freewill offerings/things freely given) (d:zuahzuah freely, with the plural te, after a verb of giving: the things given freely) (e:lungkim takin a piakkhiat ~ uh tawh) (b:zuahzuah) (r:15.7.16) (q:draft)
zuak = (t:v) (w:sell) (e:Izipt gamah a ~ uh hi) (r:44.7.9/20.31.24) (q:draft)
