zuakkhia = (t:v) (w:sell off/export) (d:zuak sell, with khia out) (e:A neihsa a ~ pa in) (b:zuak) (r:26.7.13/11.10.29) (q:draft)
zuakkhiat = (t:v) (w:sell/sell off/export) (d:zuak, sell, with khiat, out or away; the form of zuakkhia used before ding and similar words) (e:tuate ~ dingin pammaih lua hi) (b:zuakkhia) (r:20.23.23/14.1.17) (q:draft)
