zuakkik = (t:v) (w:sell back) (d:zuak sell, with kik back: let someone be bought back) (e:a pa kiang mahah ~ ding hi) (b:zuak) (r:2.21.8) (q:draft)
zuakma = (t:see) <zuakma-in>
