zuakpa = (t:n) (w:seller/merchant/trader) (d:zuak, sell, with pa, the man who sells; sum zuakpa is a merchant) (e:Van leipa in van ~ kiangah) (b:zuak) (r:20.20.14/40.13.45) (q:draft)
zuakpahte = (t:n) (w:those who sell readily) (d:zuak sell, with pah at once and the plural te: those who sell without holding back) (e:leinop hunin a ~ kiphat hi) (r:20.11.26) (q:draft)
zuaksa = (t:adj) (w:sold) (d:zuak, sell, with sa, already done; that which has been sold) (e:a ~ van ngah kik lo ding hi) (b:zuak) (r:26.7.13/3.25.25) (q:draft)
