zuakte = (t:n) (w:sellers/those who sell) (d:zuak sell with the plural te: the people who sell something) (e:Vakhu ~ kiangah zong) (b:zuak) (r:43.2.16/16.13.20) (q:draft)
zuaktheih = (t:v) (w:be able to sell) (d:zuak sell, with theih can; used before nading) (e:I mangbuhte i ~ nadingin) (b:zuak) (r:30.8.5) (q:draft)
zual = (t:adj) (w:tame/tamed) (d:of an animal, used to people, broken in; zual nai lo is not yet tamed, wild) (e:la a ~ nai lo bang ding a) (r:1.16.12) (q:draft)
