Zuar = (t:name) (c:male) (w:Zuar) (r:4.7.18/4.10.15)
zuat = (t:v) (w:go to/head for/return to) (d:make one's way toward a place or person; the form used in dependent clauses and before nading) (e:tuikhuk a ~ uh leh tui) (r:24.14.3/20.26.11) (q:draft)
zuatkik = (t:v) (w:return to/go back to) (d:zuat, head for, with kik, back or again) (e:Ui in a luak a ~ bangin) (b:zuat) (r:20.26.11/10.17.3) (q:draft)
zuatna = (t:n) (w:way to/going to) (d:the act of heading for a place; with lampi or lam, the road that leads to a place) (e:Zion ~ lampi a om mite) (b:zuat) (r:19.84.5/20.7.27) (q:draft)
zuau = (t:v) (w:evil/lie/deceive) (e:~ gen mi suakta lo ding hi) (r:20.19.5/19.34.13)
zuau-tatin = (t:v) (w:be unfaithful/act falsely) (d:zuau lie, with tat act and the linking suffix in; the same word as zuautat) (e:Amaute ~ citak lo uh hi) (r:28.7.4) (q:draft)
