zuaugenna = (t:n) (w:lying/lie/falsehood) (d:zuaugen, tell lies, with the noun suffix na) (e:~ tawh hauhnate beimang pak a) (b:zuaugen) (r:20.21.6/20.12.13) (q:draft)
