zuautatin = (t:v) (w:being unfaithful/acting falsely) (d:zuautat be unfaithful, with in linking it to the next verb) (e:Amaute ~ citak lo uh hi) (b:zuautat) (r:28.7.4/23.57.11) (q:draft)
zuautatna = (t:n) (w:falsehood/unfaithfulness/treachery/deceit) (d:acting falsely or disloyally, from zuau lie) (e:Hoshea a ~ mu hi) (b:zuautat) (r:12.17.4/45.3.7) (q:draft)
zuautatsak = (t:v) (w:cause to be unfaithful/lead astray) (d:zuautat be unfaithful, with causative sak) (e:Topa’ tungah Israel mite ~ hi) (b:zuautat) (r:4.31.16) (q:draft)
zuaute = (t:adj) (w:false/lying) (d:zuau, false, with the plural te, placed after a noun: pasian zuaute is false gods, kamsang zuaute is false prophets) (e:tua bangmahin kamsang ~ a pahtakbawl uh hi) (b:zuau) (r:42.6.26/24.14.22) (q:draft)
zuauthei = (t:adj) (w:deceitful/deceiving/lying) (d:zuau, lie, with thei, able or given to; one that deceives) (e:kam sungah ~ kha khat koih khin hi) (b:zuau) (r:11.22.23/23.30.9) (q:draft)
