zuphung = (t:n) (w:banquet/feast) (d:found only in zuphung pa, the man in charge of a wedding feast, master of the banquet; zu is wine) (e:~ pa kiangah va paipih un) (r:43.2.8/43.2.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
