zusuk = (t:v) (w:fall/rain down/pour down) (d:zu fall, of rain, with suk downward) (e:leitungah guah-in hong ~ a) (b:zu) (r:21.11.3) (q:draft)
zut = (t:n) (w:paint) (e:kultal tui tawh ~ in) (r:1.6.14)
zut = (t:n) (w:cover) (e:tuate kham tawh na ~ ding hi) (r:2.25.13)
zute = (t:n) (w:wines/drinks) (d:zu wine or fermented drink with the plural te; leenggah zute is wine of grapes) (e:leenggah ~, khuakhal ante leh sathaute) (b:zu) (r:24.40.10) (q:draft)
zuthawl = (t:n) (w:betrothal pledge/engagement) (d:pledge given to seal a promise of marriage, literally a flask of zu, rice beer; zuthawl piaksa means pledged to be married, betrothed) (e:Josef a dingin ~ piaksa hi a) (r:40.1.18/42.1.27) (q:draft, low confidence)
zutin = (t:v) (w:overlay/smear/rub/paint) (d:zut with the linking ending -in: coat with gold, rub with oil, paint the eyes) (e:tuate kham tawh ~) (b:zut) (r:2.37.4/41.6.13) (q:draft)
zutkhat = (t:todo) (r:24.46.22) (q:draft, one verse only, said of Egypt becoming like a fleeing snake where the NIV has hiss; cannot tell whether it names the sound or the gliding movement)
zutkhia = (t:see) <zutkhia-in>
zutkhia-in = (t:v) (w:strip off/pull off) (d:connective form of zutkhia, from zut rub or strip with khia out: stripping fruit off a plant and then) (e:a gahte ~, a hiangte kuaitanin) (r:26.17.9) (q:draft, low confidence)
zutna = (t:n) (w:plaster/coating) (d:zut, smear, plaster or overlay, with the noun suffix na; the material for plastering a wall, or the overlaying of a surface) (e:~ dang la-in inn zut ding hi) (b:zut) (r:3.14.42/12.18.16) (q:draft)
zutsiang = (t:adj) (w:burnished/polished) (d:apparently zut rub with siang clean: rubbed bright, said of bronze) (e:a khete sumngo ~ bangin tee daldal hi) (r:27.10.6) (q:draft, low confidence)
Zuzim = (t:name) (c:land) (w:Zuzites) (r:1.14.5)
